Zram Status
============

Device: /dev/zram0
Disksize: 60 GB
Algorithm: lzo-rle lzo lz4 lz4hc [zstd] deflate 842

Memory Usage:
  Original data: 24.7 GB
  Compressed:    7.5 GB
  RAM used:      7.7 GB
  Compression ratio: 3.3x (compressed data is 30.5% of original)

Configuration options:
  --gen-config           Generate NixOS configuration snippet
  --memory-percent <N>   Set memory percent (default: 200 for 2x RAM)
  --algorithm <algo>     Set algorithm: lzo, lz4, lz4hc, zstd (default: zstd)

Example - generate config for 2x RAM with zstd:
  dracon-system zram --gen-config --memory-percent 200 --algorithm zstd
